  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Development: Agriculture Services Programme for an Inclusive Rural Economy and Agricultural Trade</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme goal is &apos;rural poverty and vulnerability has decreased and climate resilience of Cambodian rural households has increased through inclusive and environmentally sustainable growth in the agriculture sector&apos;.
The programme development objective is &apos;inclusive and sustainable agriculture sector growth based on exports and domestic markets has increased the incomes of rural producers and workers&apos;.</narrative>
  </description>
